{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"DECISIONS APPROVED (operator, 2026-07-24) — implementation in progress on worktree 72d9-drift-basis.\n\n1. Comparison basis: signed hashes stay pinned at the review's verified_at_sha; the claim gate re-hashes at a snapshot of the CURRENT gate ref (REBAR_GATE_REF / [snapshot].ref / origin/main), resolved from the local object DB (fetch=False). source=local config or an unresolvable ref degrades to the working tree. Verified this does NOT reintroduce the ADR-0002 false positive: that was whole-HEAD SHA equality; per-path content comparison at the current ref only fires when a signed dependency file's bytes changed. Uncommitted working-tree edits move neither side, so the S4b protection is kept. Root cause note: ADR 0002's S4b addendum itself specified re-hashing 'at the SAME SHA's snapshot — identical by construction'; the consolidation over-corrected and the ADR text is being amended, not just the code.\n2. The drift-refresh path (_rehash at the active review snapshot) was already correct and is untouched; only the claim-gate branch changes.\n3. Suite default migrates local -> attested/ref=HEAD (salvaged from WIP 5bf846df9), with _commit_all and committed drift in the drift tests.\n4. test_ref_coherence.py re-pinned: uncommitted-tree drift still does not invalidate; committed drift in a signed dependency now does; unrelated committed change still does not; local back-out re-expressed as explicit REBAR_GATE_SOURCE=local.\n\nDiscovered while testing: the review-plan --help test leaks a .tickets-tracker symlink into a fresh worktree's repo root (pre-existing on main) — filed as dd62-2791-6413-4ae0 (sapient-rutile-penguin), linked discovered_from."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1784951708342390001,"uuid":"dc52583b-af69-4707-9fb8-47fed1f51acd"}